'''Watch Me Whip''' (ムチ使い, ''Muchizukai'', '''Whipper''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Cannon Start Level UP (Sm): Cannon gauge will be filled +2 steps/20% charged.

